notes: W3 container timing (edit lists / composition offsets). Self-contained (one self-reference dref entry, no paths). Swift Glance FrameTiming and DXVKit Plus agree on every frame start (docs/data/w3-crosstest-fixtures.jsonl). The script's output differs from the committed bytes only in the movie header creation dates.
